<title>USA: Omaha hogs $2-$3 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $2-$3 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>No previous day price test barrows and gilts available; compared to last Monday.</p>
<p>$2.00-$3.00 higher. Top $55.00. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-250 lbs    55.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent.  Not established.</p>
</text>
